From: u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com (Ben Goodrich)
Date: Mon, 04 Aug 2014 06:51:13 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] [stan-users] Rhat for lp__
Message-ID: <lMy2CZJD9fk.94wcWEh5UAQJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
