From u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com  Tue Aug  5 00:08:02 2014
From: u743bbacc59f4b25f at groups.google.com (Ben Goodrich)
Date: Tue, 05 Aug 2014 00:08:02 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] [stan-users] Rhat for lp__
Message-ID: <lMy2CZJD9fk.OzfRuVinXr4J@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <lMy2CZJD9fk.9q2Y-C-msWIJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <lMy2CZJD9fk.jB4pz8ZCd9gJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <lMy2CZJD9fk.9q2Y-C-msWIJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-dev/c/lMy2CZJD9fk/m/OzfRuVinXr4J>
