> > Eigen 3.2.2 has been released today, on August 4, 2014.
> >
> > This is a maintenance release with many bug fixes since the release of
> > 3.2.1 five months ago. In particular, this release includes various
> > numerical improvements in JacobiSVD, LDLT, BiCGSTAB, and
> > ColPivHouseholderQR. There are also some limited performance improvements
> > and added functionality in the 3.2.2 release.
> >
> > The source archive is at
> > http://bitbucket.org/eigen/eigen/get/3.2.2.tar.bz2
