Date: Tue, 05 Aug 2014 17:54:44 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] Re: [eigen] Eigen 3.2.2 is released!
Message-ID: <sfKYwHjWcQA.i5p3PrtLytwJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <sfKYwHjWcQA.SqDpDItARYAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
References: <sfKYwHjWcQA.6yP52bFroKwJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com> <sfKYwHjWcQA.SqDpDItARYAJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
