From u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com  Tue Aug 26 20:58:04 2014
From: u8aa9b8cc06fdc99c at groups.google.com (Bob Carpenter)
Date: Tue, 26 Aug 2014 20:58:04 +0000
Subject: Re: [stan-dev] Nomad I/O Validation
Message-ID: <VOtdgWefXXg.Air8RX4SfqQJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <VOtdgWefXXg.1O5bZFW6NJwJ@stan-dev.groups.google.com>
